# The VSIX holds only what the extension runs and the documents the
# Marketplace shows: everything else is left out, then these are let back in
# (vsce applies the exceptions last, so they name what to ship, maps excepted).
**
!package.json
!out/**/*.cjs
!out/**/*.js
!out/**/*.css
!alloy/alloy.jar
!alloy/alloy-session.jar
!media/**
!syntaxes/**
!language-configuration.json
!README.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!LICENSE
!THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
